@codeGroupId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health: Root check
GET {{HostAddress}}/
Accept: text/plain

### Health: Database check
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/health/db
Accept: application/json

### Import: Upload spreadsheet
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/assets/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="майно.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ../../майно.xlsx
--boundary--

###

# ===================================================================
# Code Groups API
# ===================================================================

### Code Groups: First page (default 25 items)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/code-groups
Accept: application/json

> {%
    if (response.body.items && response.body.items.length > 0) {
        client.global.set("codeGroupId", response.body.items[0].id);
    }
%}

### Code Groups: Search by accountant code
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/code-groups?search=1113&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Code Groups: Search by source name
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/code-groups?search=Стілець&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Code Groups: Custom pagination
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/code-groups?page=2&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Code Group: Detail with contributing source rows
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/code-groups/{{codeGroupId}}
Accept: application/json

### Code Group: Detail (404 Not Found check)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/code-groups/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Code Groups: Invalid pagination (400 Bad Request check)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/code-groups?page=0&pageSize=25
Accept: application/json
